WEBVTT

01:40.560 --> 01:42.000
Ladies and gentlemen.

01:51.150 --> 01:52.200
Mom, you're back.

01:52.590 --> 01:53.350
Let's eat.

01:53.440 --> 01:54.150
Okay.

01:57.789 --> 02:00.150
It seems we've got ourselves a little Cinderella in the house.

02:01.310 --> 02:03.150
Here. I didn't use soybean oil to stir-fry it.

02:03.590 --> 02:04.430
I used rapeseed oil.

02:04.710 --> 02:05.840
Stir-frying with rapeseed oil makes it more delicious.

02:06.200 --> 02:07.310
You've learned well from me.

02:11.240 --> 02:12.240
You're looking at it again.

02:13.280 --> 02:14.840
You really want to be a model?

02:18.520 --> 02:21.079
Mom, I also told Siyi about it just now.

02:21.079 --> 02:22.710
If she could also do the shoot,

02:22.710 --> 02:23.910
that would be awesome.

02:24.280 --> 02:26.079
It's much faster money than working a regular job.

02:27.630 --> 02:29.680
Aren't you worried they might prefer Siyi

02:29.680 --> 02:30.680
and eliminate you?

02:32.520 --> 02:33.630
That's not likely, is it?

02:34.840 --> 02:37.079
Who would choose a Xiali when they could have a Mercedes?

02:37.680 --> 02:38.520
Mom!

02:39.750 --> 02:41.190
I was just teasing you.

02:42.030 --> 02:43.470
In my heart,

02:43.470 --> 02:45.190
my daughter Fenghua is the prettiest.

02:45.400 --> 02:46.520
Even prettier than Gong Li or Zhang Ziyi,

02:46.560 --> 02:47.400
or anyone else.

02:55.470 --> 02:56.400
What's wrong?

02:57.280 --> 02:58.190
Are you worried?

03:02.280 --> 03:05.840
If they could only choose one of us for the ad shoot,

03:07.750 --> 03:08.680
I'd rather they choose Siyi.

03:08.750 --> 03:09.470
I'm okay with that.

03:11.750 --> 03:12.630
Why?

03:13.190 --> 03:15.280
I have parents and everything.

03:15.280 --> 03:16.840
Siyi needs the money more than I do.

03:22.030 --> 03:22.840
What?

03:23.280 --> 03:24.470
Is it wrong for me to think this way?

03:25.760 --> 03:27.000
No, it's not wrong.

03:27.910 --> 03:29.470
If you treat her as a friend,

03:29.470 --> 03:31.750
it's right to think of her needs more.

03:32.190 --> 03:33.470
Money-making opportunities,

03:33.840 --> 03:35.200
if lost, can be found again.

03:37.280 --> 03:38.310
But it's just,

03:42.750 --> 03:43.800
if one day,

03:45.680 --> 03:49.000
you need to give up something else...

03:49.800 --> 03:51.960
Something else? What do you mean by that?

03:56.520 --> 03:57.280
It's nothing.

03:58.280 --> 03:59.000
What is it?

03:59.400 --> 04:00.150
Never mind.

04:00.990 --> 04:02.360
Fenghua, are you home?

04:03.120 --> 04:03.870
I'm not!

04:12.800 --> 04:13.400
Fenghua.

04:16.390 --> 04:17.390
Go away.

04:18.800 --> 04:19.560
Let's talk for a bit.

04:19.829 --> 04:20.600
Not available.

04:21.269 --> 04:22.400
Come on, just a quick chat.

04:24.950 --> 04:25.630
Come on.

04:49.270 --> 04:50.750
Alright, who wants to go first?

04:58.560 --> 04:59.390
What is this?

05:02.350 --> 05:05.390
A reimbursement voucher for Chris Lee's concert ticket.

05:06.800 --> 05:07.560
What does that mean?

05:08.070 --> 05:09.720
From now on, when you buy concert tickets,

05:09.720 --> 05:10.950
no matter how much they cost,

05:11.000 --> 05:12.000
we'll reimburse you.

05:25.560 --> 05:26.480
That's not necessary.

05:26.830 --> 05:28.270
I don't need your money.

05:29.000 --> 05:31.830
This is our way of showing we care.

05:39.870 --> 05:40.800
Sorry!

05:41.270 --> 05:42.510
We were wrong.

05:52.480 --> 05:53.310
Is Chris good?

05:53.360 --> 05:54.159
Yes.

05:54.600 --> 05:55.680
Does she sing well?

05:55.720 --> 05:56.470
Yes, she does.

05:58.240 --> 06:00.240
If any one of you dares to mess with me again,

06:00.480 --> 06:00.950
I...

06:04.040 --> 06:05.910
I'll sneak into your rooms at night

06:06.560 --> 06:08.360
and shave all your heads one by one.

06:08.600 --> 06:09.560
Why aren't you dodging?

06:10.600 --> 06:11.360
Why are you laughing?

06:13.160 --> 06:13.950
Don't let this happen again.

06:19.680 --> 06:20.750
Fixed that. Let's go.

06:25.510 --> 06:26.950
What's got you so happy?

06:26.950 --> 06:27.920
Nothing.

06:57.240 --> 06:57.680
Cheers.

07:05.600 --> 07:06.070
Alright.

07:13.160 --> 07:14.360
The other day,

07:15.480 --> 07:18.240
I ran into Siyi at the hospital. She was going to tutor Chen Rui.

07:19.480 --> 07:20.720
Well,

07:20.720 --> 07:22.000
I don't know what I was thinking.

07:22.000 --> 07:23.360
I... I just

07:23.920 --> 07:25.830
blurted out to Siyi,

07:26.480 --> 07:29.310
"Why don't you come stay at our place?"

07:34.120 --> 07:36.030
You invited Siyi to live with us?

07:36.470 --> 07:38.000
Are you trying to kick me out?

07:39.000 --> 07:39.600
Or are you

07:40.040 --> 07:41.800
trying to create an opportunity for her and our son?

07:42.159 --> 07:43.310
No, it's not like that.

07:43.360 --> 07:45.360
I only did that for our son's studies.

07:45.360 --> 07:47.950
His tutoring while in the hospital is the most important thing right now.

07:48.000 --> 07:49.560
That girl has been helping Chen Rui.

07:49.600 --> 07:51.680
And I thought since she's going through a lot,

07:51.680 --> 07:53.159
I wanted to help her out too.

07:53.159 --> 07:54.240
After all, I have a car.

07:54.240 --> 07:55.870
Stop, just stop.

07:55.920 --> 07:57.390
You're meddling too much.

07:57.720 --> 07:59.640
Our son has complained to me many times in private,

07:59.680 --> 08:00.920
saying you meddle in everything,

08:01.360 --> 08:02.040
from his studies,

08:02.040 --> 08:03.600
his life, to his friendships.

08:03.600 --> 08:04.430
He's fed up with it.

08:04.480 --> 08:06.680
Boys need to be given more freedom, you know?

08:06.680 --> 08:07.560
If I don't take care of those things, who will?

08:07.600 --> 08:08.720
I'm his mother.

08:08.720 --> 08:09.560
And speaking of his friendships,

08:09.600 --> 08:10.630
just look at those friends he made,

08:10.680 --> 08:11.720
like Xie Wanghe.

08:11.720 --> 08:13.270
Is there even one good student among them?

08:13.360 --> 08:15.800
They'll all have a bad influence on him.

08:16.480 --> 08:18.480
Poor grades don't mean they're bad people.

08:18.480 --> 08:19.240
That's a different matter.

08:19.240 --> 08:21.150
We are all neighbors. We know each other very well.

08:22.040 --> 08:24.040
Besides, Ma Siyi

08:24.040 --> 08:25.390
hangs out with them every day.

08:25.680 --> 08:27.160
It hasn't affected her studies.

08:27.160 --> 08:28.360
She got into the same school as our son,

08:28.360 --> 08:28.720
No. 1 High School, right?

08:28.720 --> 08:29.680
Oh, please.

08:30.240 --> 08:32.789
Can't you tell your son's got a crush

08:32.789 --> 08:33.840
on Ma Siyi?

08:34.480 --> 08:35.270
I can.

08:35.360 --> 08:36.150
So what?

08:36.789 --> 08:39.150
"So what?" Let me tell you.

08:39.150 --> 08:41.150
This little spark of our son's puppy love

08:41.360 --> 08:43.080
must be strangled at birth.

08:43.360 --> 08:44.360
It's non-negotiable.

08:47.150 --> 08:49.390
You're too cold-hearted.

08:50.600 --> 08:51.390
You know what?

08:51.670 --> 08:53.150
I was also

08:53.150 --> 08:54.390
once our son's age.

08:54.390 --> 08:56.720
It's normal for a boy to like a girl.

08:56.720 --> 08:57.840
As the ancients said,

08:57.840 --> 08:58.910
"A beautiful and virtuous woman

08:58.910 --> 08:59.790
is what a gentleman pursues."

08:59.790 --> 09:00.910
Back in my day...

09:07.240 --> 09:08.390
What happened back in your day?

09:10.150 --> 09:11.870
Back in my day...

09:12.360 --> 09:13.360
Which year do you mean exactly?

09:14.720 --> 09:16.000
And who's in that story?

09:16.720 --> 09:18.390
Why haven't you ever told me about this?

09:21.150 --> 09:22.440
Back in my day,

09:24.480 --> 09:26.390
I didn't have the chance for puppy love.

09:28.320 --> 09:30.480
But times are different now.

09:30.600 --> 09:31.720
Our son is at this age when

09:31.720 --> 09:33.910
the more you try to control him, the more he'll rebel, you know?

09:33.910 --> 09:34.870
He'll do the opposite of what you say.

09:36.030 --> 09:37.910
So according to you, I should just leave him alone

09:37.910 --> 09:38.720
and let him be?

09:38.720 --> 09:40.480
Free to date like you were?

09:42.390 --> 09:44.440
You need to use the right approaches and methods.

09:44.910 --> 09:46.360
We should learn wisdom from the ancients.

09:46.390 --> 09:47.870
Look at how Yu the Great controlled the floods.

09:47.910 --> 09:49.360
He mainly adopted the method of diversion and channeling instead of...

09:49.360 --> 09:51.360
Don't give me that useless talk.

09:51.360 --> 09:52.630
Let me tell you.

09:52.670 --> 09:54.150
Regarding our son's puppy love,

09:54.150 --> 09:55.360
you better handle it well.

09:55.670 --> 09:57.670
Show me what great wisdom you have.

09:57.670 --> 09:58.720
If you can't handle it properly,

09:58.720 --> 10:00.550
we'll deal with it from the root.

10:01.000 --> 10:02.480
Then you'll have to come clean with me:

10:02.480 --> 10:04.440
Who was your puppy love?

10:04.480 --> 10:05.840
What's her name?

10:06.120 --> 10:07.480
Where is she now?

10:07.480 --> 10:08.910
Are you still in contact?

10:08.960 --> 10:11.000
Is our son taking after you?

10:14.630 --> 10:15.750
Please rest assured, Boss.

10:16.190 --> 10:17.480
I promise I'll complete the mission.

10:39.720 --> 10:40.360
Dad.

10:42.240 --> 10:42.960
What's up?

10:44.630 --> 10:45.480
Can you do me a favor?

10:46.240 --> 10:47.150
Go ahead.

10:50.630 --> 10:53.750
Could you help me deliver this letter?

10:58.870 --> 10:59.720
A love letter?

11:00.000 --> 11:00.960
No, it's not.

11:01.080 --> 11:01.840
What are you talking about?

11:01.870 --> 11:02.870
Don't make wild guesses.

11:02.870 --> 11:03.910
It's nothing like that.

11:04.320 --> 11:07.200
We're just good friends, nothing more.

11:07.480 --> 11:08.000
There's really nothing going on.

11:08.000 --> 11:09.240
There's absolutely nothing ambiguous, you know...

11:09.630 --> 11:10.870
Alright, forget it. Just give it back to me.

11:13.320 --> 11:14.440
It's just the other day,

11:14.480 --> 11:16.960
my mom said something inappropriate to her, right?

11:16.960 --> 11:18.630
So I thought I'd explain to her.

11:18.630 --> 11:19.480
You understand, right?

11:19.960 --> 11:20.750
Why are you so nervous?

11:22.480 --> 11:23.440
I'm not your mom.

11:24.200 --> 11:25.000
Yeah, right.

11:25.000 --> 11:25.600
Still...

11:25.600 --> 11:26.720
Besides,

11:27.480 --> 11:28.960
even if it is a love letter,

11:29.000 --> 11:29.750
so what?

11:30.960 --> 11:32.870
Everyone's written a love letter at some point.

11:38.630 --> 11:40.030
You want to hear my story?

11:41.590 --> 11:42.870
I promise I won't tell Mom.

11:49.480 --> 11:51.080
When I was in senior high school,

11:51.960 --> 11:53.240
there was also

11:53.240 --> 11:55.440
a female classmate I was close to.

11:56.960 --> 11:59.200
Back then, I wrote to her a lot, too.

11:59.840 --> 12:00.960
Just the stamps alone,

12:01.510 --> 12:03.390
I collected enough to fill a small, thick notebook.

12:11.440 --> 12:12.840
So you'll be a second-generation celebrity?

12:13.720 --> 12:14.750
I can't say whether I'll be a second-generation celebrity or not,

12:15.000 --> 12:16.320
but I surely will have connections in the entertainment industry.

12:23.000 --> 12:24.070
Isn't that Siyi?

12:30.000 --> 12:30.750
Siyi!

12:32.600 --> 12:33.270
Stop there!

12:34.480 --> 12:35.030
Siyi!

12:39.080 --> 12:39.750
What are you doing?

12:40.510 --> 12:41.600
Are you working part-time?

12:43.360 --> 12:44.000
It's none of your business.

12:45.000 --> 12:45.720
Does Grandma know about this?

12:46.360 --> 12:48.480
If you dare to tell her, I won't forgive you.

12:49.200 --> 12:49.720
Siyi.

12:51.000 --> 12:51.720
How much more money do you need?

12:51.960 --> 12:52.720
We'll make up the difference for you.

12:53.360 --> 12:55.240
Go back to school immediately.

12:55.240 --> 12:55.960
Do you hear me?

12:56.320 --> 12:58.080
You should be the one to go to school and study, okay?

12:58.080 --> 12:59.080
You don't have to worry about me.

13:00.240 --> 13:02.240
I won't be able to get into university. I only need a diploma.

13:02.440 --> 13:03.120
But you are different.

13:03.360 --> 13:04.670
This last year is very important for you.

13:04.720 --> 13:05.960
You can't waste a single minute.

13:06.080 --> 13:06.510
Go home!

13:07.080 --> 13:08.630
If you don't go home, I'll tell your homeroom teacher.

13:08.630 --> 13:09.520
I'll have her contact Grandma.

13:09.720 --> 13:10.200
Let go.

13:10.720 --> 13:11.120
Go home!

13:11.120 --> 13:12.000
Let go of me!

13:15.240 --> 13:16.120
Can't you just listen to me?

13:16.840 --> 13:17.720
Xie Wanghe!

13:18.190 --> 13:19.240
You may be able to help me once or twice,

13:19.240 --> 13:20.600
but do you think you can take care of me for a lifetime?

13:20.600 --> 13:21.240
I can!

13:31.440 --> 13:32.200
But I can't.

13:40.240 --> 13:40.910
Siyi!

13:45.910 --> 13:46.750
So,

13:47.630 --> 13:49.440
in the end, which one of you

13:49.440 --> 13:50.960
changed your mind first?

13:53.760 --> 13:55.120
We...

13:55.840 --> 13:57.080
We never confessed our feelings to each other.

13:57.120 --> 13:58.120
So

13:58.720 --> 13:59.750
we can't really say who fell out of love first.

14:01.320 --> 14:02.360
Why didn't you confess your feelings?

14:04.630 --> 14:05.360
How should I put it?

14:12.320 --> 14:13.600
your generation,

14:14.120 --> 14:15.440
when it comes to relationships,

14:15.840 --> 14:16.630
is more...

14:17.000 --> 14:17.840
Casual.

14:18.480 --> 14:20.360
If you like someone, you just get together.

14:20.360 --> 14:21.480
If you don't feel it anymore, you break up.

14:22.240 --> 14:23.960
It was different back in our time.

14:24.630 --> 14:25.960
Even if you liked someone,

14:26.000 --> 14:29.030
you had to weigh it carefully in your mind.

14:29.080 --> 14:30.240
Weigh it.

14:31.750 --> 14:33.030
Weigh what?

14:35.000 --> 14:35.870
What is it?

14:37.120 --> 14:38.600
Whether you can make that person happy or not.

14:39.240 --> 14:40.390
If you like someone,

14:41.240 --> 14:42.240
you only need to be thick-skinned

14:42.750 --> 14:44.550
to confess your feelings.

14:45.600 --> 14:47.550
But if you truly like someone,

14:48.840 --> 14:50.360
you must be clear about

14:50.360 --> 14:52.480
what you can do for that person.

14:58.320 --> 15:00.000
But if there's something I can't do now,

15:00.750 --> 15:02.870
it doesn't mean I won't be able to do that in the future, right?

15:03.840 --> 15:04.240
Right.

15:04.840 --> 15:07.080
So if you want to make that person happy,

15:07.600 --> 15:09.120
you must do everything you can

15:09.120 --> 15:11.040
to make yourself stand out.

15:12.120 --> 15:14.120
In a responsible relationship,

15:14.440 --> 15:16.750
actions speak louder than words.

15:18.480 --> 15:19.750
Right now,

15:19.750 --> 15:21.240
you're relying on your parents.

15:22.840 --> 15:24.760
If you can't provide that person

15:24.760 --> 15:25.840
with enough support and care

15:25.840 --> 15:28.600
on your own,

15:28.600 --> 15:30.670
then it's not the time to start a relationship.

15:48.480 --> 15:49.000
Are you alright?

15:49.960 --> 15:50.600
How are you feeling?

16:19.790 --> 16:21.150
What time is it now?

16:22.670 --> 16:23.750
We have to hurry up.

16:23.870 --> 16:25.480
I still have to meet Jiu for the card game.

16:27.150 --> 16:28.360
You're annoying.

16:40.360 --> 16:41.200
Crippled Sun!

16:43.120 --> 16:45.840
Xie Tiancheng, what are you doing here?

16:46.150 --> 16:48.240
If you don't give me the money today,

16:48.270 --> 16:49.080
I'll kill you!

16:53.390 --> 16:55.910
I told you I have no money. Which part of that you don't understand?

16:55.910 --> 16:57.910
No money? You have no money, but you are fooling around with women?

16:57.910 --> 16:59.150
You even drive a Mercedes.

16:59.150 --> 17:00.510
You've got some nerve, Xie Tiancheng.

17:00.510 --> 17:02.720
You even dare to break in and steal.

17:10.200 --> 17:12.829
Murder! Murder!

17:50.720 --> 17:51.960
It's not very serious.

17:51.960 --> 17:53.240
Rest more at home.

17:53.240 --> 17:54.400
Keep that in mind, okay?

17:54.400 --> 17:54.920
Alright.

18:08.200 --> 18:09.190
Come on, come on.

18:09.190 --> 18:09.830
Have a seat.

18:09.880 --> 18:10.480
Come on, come on.

18:10.480 --> 18:11.830
Have a seat.

18:11.880 --> 18:12.600
Sit.

18:17.200 --> 18:18.000
What are you looking at?

18:20.390 --> 18:21.160
It doesn't seem

18:21.880 --> 18:23.200
like a big deal.

18:24.880 --> 18:26.640
I'm fine,

18:26.640 --> 18:27.830
but you're not.

18:28.950 --> 18:29.790
Aggravated assault.

18:30.510 --> 18:31.510
That's enough for a few years in prison.

18:32.200 --> 18:33.440
I only kicked you once.

18:33.510 --> 18:34.400
You lost your balance.

18:34.400 --> 18:35.070
You fell

18:35.110 --> 18:36.510
and injured yourself.

18:36.510 --> 18:37.640
How did that become an aggravated assault?

18:37.640 --> 18:39.680
W-What do you mean I did it to myself?

18:40.070 --> 18:42.270
I didn't take these X-rays, did I?

18:43.510 --> 18:44.920
I got seven stitches

18:45.880 --> 18:46.920
and a mild concussion.

18:47.390 --> 18:48.480
Let me tell you something.

18:48.510 --> 18:50.160
If I report this to the Public Security Bureau,

18:50.200 --> 18:51.240
it would be assault and battery,

18:51.790 --> 18:53.870
where the victim doesn't accept mediation.

18:54.880 --> 18:56.270
Think about the consequences yourself.

19:00.510 --> 19:01.680
Give me back the money first.

19:02.350 --> 19:03.440
I'll take full responsibility.

19:04.520 --> 19:05.270
Taking full responsibility?

19:05.270 --> 19:06.680
Can you really handle it?

19:07.270 --> 19:07.640
Let me ask you,

19:07.640 --> 19:08.920
you hit me first, didn't you?

19:10.400 --> 19:11.790
You kicked me, didn't you?

19:13.680 --> 19:15.550
You could have sued me

19:15.590 --> 19:17.350
for not paying you.

19:17.350 --> 19:18.790
Why did you have to use violence?

19:19.350 --> 19:19.880
I'm telling you,

19:19.880 --> 19:21.310
if I were less decent,

19:21.350 --> 19:22.880
I could add another charge against you.

19:22.880 --> 19:24.510
Burglary.

19:25.590 --> 19:26.790
Even if it was just an attempt,

19:27.590 --> 19:28.880
that would be enough to convict you.

19:35.790 --> 19:36.590
Xie.

19:37.400 --> 19:38.750
We're both reasonable people,

19:40.110 --> 19:42.000
so I won't beat around the bush.

19:43.160 --> 19:44.200
This beating,

19:45.350 --> 19:46.400
to put it bluntly,

19:47.350 --> 19:48.510
I had it coming.

19:49.960 --> 19:51.350
The money I owe you,

19:52.270 --> 19:53.400
let's consider it as my medical expenses.

19:53.400 --> 19:54.110
This matter between us,

19:54.110 --> 19:55.350
let's put an end to it, okay?

19:57.110 --> 19:57.830
What? What?

19:57.880 --> 19:59.110
What do you mean put an end to it?

19:59.110 --> 19:59.550
On what grounds?

19:59.590 --> 20:00.350
This won't do!

20:00.640 --> 20:01.440
Let's go then.

20:01.440 --> 20:01.920
Let's go!

20:01.960 --> 20:02.440
Where are you going?

20:02.440 --> 20:03.200
To the Public Security Bureau.

20:03.400 --> 20:03.830
What?

20:04.110 --> 20:05.160
To assess injuries and determine sentencing.

20:05.160 --> 20:05.750
Come on, let's go.

20:08.590 --> 20:09.720
You'd better think about

20:09.720 --> 20:11.400
where you're going to borrow money for legal fees.

20:20.030 --> 20:20.400
You...

20:20.590 --> 20:21.000
What are you doing?

20:21.480 --> 20:21.880
You...

20:21.880 --> 20:23.310
Are you going to continue causing harm to me?

20:23.400 --> 20:24.400
You, you...

20:24.400 --> 20:25.240
How many stitches did you get?

20:25.640 --> 20:26.110
Seven stitches.

20:26.110 --> 20:26.550
What?

20:26.590 --> 20:27.640
Are you going to remove them for me now?

20:27.640 --> 20:28.550
Take it.

20:28.880 --> 20:29.550
Take it

20:29.880 --> 20:30.400
and make

20:30.590 --> 20:31.480
a cut right here.

20:31.480 --> 20:32.400
I'll pay you back those seven stitches.

20:32.590 --> 20:33.270
I don't want it.

20:33.400 --> 20:34.240
I'll do it myself.

20:35.440 --> 20:36.240
Give it to me!

20:36.960 --> 20:37.590
Xie!

20:37.960 --> 20:39.680
W-What are you doing?

20:43.350 --> 20:43.830
Cripple.

20:44.160 --> 20:45.440
I'm begging you one last time.

20:45.440 --> 20:47.240
Please give me back that money.

20:47.440 --> 20:49.590
That money may seem like a small amount to you,

20:49.640 --> 20:50.440
but for me,

20:50.440 --> 20:51.880
it's life-saving money.

20:51.920 --> 20:52.550
Cripple.

20:52.880 --> 20:53.110
Please?

20:53.110 --> 20:53.790
Xie!

20:54.440 --> 20:56.110
I'm a victim too.

20:56.110 --> 20:57.030
What did you say?

20:57.110 --> 20:57.960
You're a victim?

20:57.960 --> 20:59.240
I'll be honest with you.

20:59.400 --> 21:00.400
My supplier

21:01.400 --> 21:02.630
abandoned his construction project

21:02.680 --> 21:03.830
and ran off with the money.

21:04.160 --> 21:06.070
He still owes me the final payment.

21:07.720 --> 21:08.750
My Mercedes

21:09.720 --> 21:10.760
will have to be used to pay off debts.

21:11.830 --> 21:12.880
It'll be taken away the day after tomorrow.

21:17.160 --> 21:17.960
Xie.

21:19.480 --> 21:20.830
It's like the hot potato game.

21:22.350 --> 21:24.110
The potato is in your hands now.

21:53.550 --> 21:54.440
I'm back.

21:56.310 --> 21:56.920
Have you had dinner?

21:57.080 --> 21:57.590
Yes, I have.

21:57.640 --> 21:58.200
Have you eaten?

21:58.590 --> 21:59.400
Our son wasn't home tonight,

21:59.440 --> 22:00.200
so I didn't cook.

22:00.550 --> 22:01.640
I had a bite at Yan's place.

22:02.440 --> 22:03.270
About that money...

22:43.550 --> 22:45.680
Come on and take a look. Soy milk and fried dough sticks.

22:46.350 --> 22:48.160
Freshly fried dough sticks.

22:49.030 --> 22:51.270
Yan'er, take a rest. Sit down and save some energy.

22:52.550 --> 22:54.600
There's even no place for me to use my energy, you know?

22:54.880 --> 22:56.110
We make so many every day,

22:56.110 --> 22:57.400
but we can't sell any of it.

22:57.400 --> 22:59.480
Forget about making money. We're just suffering losses.

22:59.480 --> 23:00.590
It will get better.

23:01.950 --> 23:03.000
Everything will be fine.

23:04.550 --> 23:06.750
How about I sing a little for you

23:06.750 --> 23:08.480
while there's no one here?

23:08.830 --> 23:09.720
Sure. That's great.

23:09.750 --> 23:11.160
It's been so long since I last heard you sing.

23:11.830 --> 23:13.150
The 'Amusement park nightmare' again?

23:13.550 --> 23:14.110
Sure.

23:14.110 --> 23:15.350
I love hearing this one.

23:15.350 --> 23:16.000
Alright.

23:19.200 --> 23:24.590
♫Originally♫

23:25.590 --> 23:34.200
♫The purple♫

23:35.240 --> 23:45.270
♫And red blossoms bloom everywhere♫

23:46.960 --> 23:47.790
♫Everywhere♫

23:52.070 --> 23:52.750
Look.

23:53.960 --> 23:55.070
I'm old now.

23:56.200 --> 23:58.310
I can't even catch my breath anymore.

23:58.830 --> 23:59.880
It's beautiful.

24:00.750 --> 24:01.560
Take a rest.

24:02.310 --> 24:05.110
Could you watch the stall for me for a bit?

24:05.550 --> 24:06.590
I have a pot on the stove at home,

24:06.590 --> 24:08.110
simmering some lotus root soup.

24:08.110 --> 24:09.310
I'll go back and check on it.

24:10.590 --> 24:11.350
Be careful.

24:11.590 --> 24:12.350
Be careful.

24:12.350 --> 24:13.350
Okay, okay.

24:14.110 --> 24:15.200
You go.

24:15.240 --> 24:16.790
Go. Don't worry.

24:20.200 --> 24:21.350
Take a rest at home.

24:21.350 --> 24:22.240
We're here.

24:24.880 --> 24:25.600
Let me.

24:26.110 --> 24:27.110
It's okay. Look.

24:28.880 --> 24:30.110
This one's burnt.

24:31.070 --> 24:31.720
What's wrong with Granny?

24:31.720 --> 24:32.880
She doesn't look well.

24:33.830 --> 24:34.710
Look at these fried radish cakes.

24:34.710 --> 24:36.510
She put them in and forgot to take them out.

24:40.240 --> 24:40.960
Later,

24:41.350 --> 24:42.750
I'll have Wanghe call a traditional Chinese doctor

24:42.750 --> 24:44.030
to check on Granny Ma.

24:46.590 --> 24:47.590
Let me see your tongue.

24:53.310 --> 24:54.960
How have you been sleeping lately?

24:57.830 --> 25:00.000
I've always slept quite well.

25:00.000 --> 25:01.310
But recently, in the middle of the night,

25:01.310 --> 25:03.470
I'd wake up around three or four o'clock.

25:04.110 --> 25:05.310
Come on, squeeze my hand.

25:06.590 --> 25:07.240
Harder.

25:09.110 --> 25:09.590
This one.

25:14.590 --> 25:15.550
I... I... I...

25:15.590 --> 25:16.880
What's wrong with me?

25:18.590 --> 25:20.310
Don't worry. It's nothing serious.

25:21.270 --> 25:22.480
As people get older,

25:22.750 --> 25:24.750
some symptoms start to show up.

25:25.000 --> 25:26.110
I'll prescribe some medicine for you.

25:26.590 --> 25:27.550
Take it for now.

25:27.550 --> 25:28.110
Okay.

25:28.550 --> 25:30.070
As for the physical labors at home,

25:30.070 --> 25:31.640
try to do less of them from now on.

25:34.030 --> 25:34.590
Alright.

25:35.160 --> 25:36.200
Thank you.

25:36.350 --> 25:37.160
You're welcome.

25:39.110 --> 25:40.310
Thank you, Doctor,

25:40.310 --> 25:41.510
for coming all this way.

25:45.590 --> 25:47.200
How is Granny's condition?

25:49.880 --> 25:51.400
Are you all her relatives?

25:51.830 --> 25:52.830
Yes, we all are.

25:52.830 --> 25:53.880
Any immediate family members?

25:54.510 --> 25:55.790
She's our biological grandmother.

25:56.880 --> 25:59.000
The elderly lady may have had a cerebrovascular event recently.

26:00.310 --> 26:01.510
In other words, a stroke.

26:01.830 --> 26:04.110
If it's severe, it could lead to hemiplegia.

26:04.110 --> 26:06.310
At her age, if she has a stroke,

26:06.350 --> 26:08.510
it'll be a disaster for the family.

26:10.590 --> 26:13.110
You need to keep a close eye on her.

26:13.110 --> 26:14.200
Also, be mentally prepared.

26:28.110 --> 26:29.590
You are finally home.

26:29.880 --> 26:31.750
Why don't you just live outside? Do you know what time it is?

26:32.280 --> 26:33.110
I had things to do.

26:34.160 --> 26:35.200
What could you possibly have to do?

26:35.200 --> 26:36.960
All you do is eat and mess around.

26:37.310 --> 26:39.070
Even trust fund babies don't waste their time like you do.

26:39.510 --> 26:40.070
Oh, right.

26:40.350 --> 26:41.590
What did the traditional Chinese doctor say?

26:42.110 --> 26:43.200
Is Granny Ma alright?

26:46.270 --> 26:47.030
Granny Ma...

26:48.110 --> 26:49.160
May have a stroke soon.

26:53.350 --> 26:54.070
The doctor said

26:54.790 --> 26:56.590
Granny Ma is showing signs of an impending stroke.

26:57.070 --> 26:58.830
We need to be prepared.

27:00.110 --> 27:00.880
A stroke?

27:04.200 --> 27:05.760
That's no small matter.

27:06.270 --> 27:07.440
The doctor suggested

27:07.510 --> 27:08.880
we take Granny Ma to the hospital

27:08.880 --> 27:10.160
for a comprehensive examination.

27:11.110 --> 27:11.590
Yes.

27:12.000 --> 27:12.750
We must do it.

27:12.750 --> 27:14.200
I'll find a way to take her there for the examination.

27:15.000 --> 27:15.830
Also, Mom,

27:15.830 --> 27:18.480
starting tomorrow, Granny Ma can't work at her stall anymore.

27:19.000 --> 27:19.790
She can't overexert herself.

27:19.790 --> 27:20.750
And there has to be someone

27:20.750 --> 27:22.070
watching her at all times.

27:22.270 --> 27:23.400
If she really has a stroke

27:23.400 --> 27:24.480
and doesn't receive immediate treatment,

27:24.680 --> 27:25.720
the consequences could be severe.

27:26.200 --> 27:28.200
But with her family's financial situation,

27:29.110 --> 27:30.480
how will they make ends meet without working?

27:33.750 --> 27:36.200
I'll figure out a way to handle the money issue.

27:36.750 --> 27:37.920
What are you up to this time?

27:39.200 --> 27:39.510
Mom.

27:39.550 --> 27:40.680
You're not allowed to drop out of school.

27:40.680 --> 27:41.590
I'm telling you again,

27:41.590 --> 27:42.680
I won't allow it.

27:44.110 --> 27:44.750
Your father and I

27:44.790 --> 27:45.590
are still here.

27:45.590 --> 27:47.360
It's not your turn to meddle in this.

27:47.360 --> 27:48.680
I'm not dropping out.

27:49.070 --> 27:51.350
I'll just apply for a one-year leave of absence.

27:51.350 --> 27:52.310
Once I make enough money...

27:52.310 --> 27:53.110
That's a hard no!

27:54.640 --> 27:56.200
Granny Ma is in a dangerous situation right now.

27:56.200 --> 27:57.350
If anything happens to her,

27:57.350 --> 27:58.440
Siyi will have no way out.

27:58.510 --> 27:59.160
I have to help her.

27:59.160 --> 28:00.270
How are you going to help her?

28:00.310 --> 28:02.110
I have many ways to make money.

28:02.110 --> 28:03.680
As long as I have enough startup capital

28:03.680 --> 28:04.550
and time.

28:04.750 --> 28:05.680
One year will be enough.

28:06.110 --> 28:07.560
I can not only help Siyi,

28:07.560 --> 28:09.590
but I can also fill the financial holes in our family.

28:09.590 --> 28:10.790
Please trust me, Mom.

28:10.790 --> 28:12.310
No means no!

28:12.310 --> 28:14.160
This matter is not up for discussion!

28:14.590 --> 28:16.000
Why are you being so unreasonable?

28:21.880 --> 28:23.070
Your father said

28:23.510 --> 28:25.510
he'd be able to collect the outstanding debts soon.

28:26.110 --> 28:27.510
Once we get the money back,

28:27.680 --> 28:29.200
everything can be resolved.

28:29.550 --> 28:31.350
You only need to study hard

28:31.350 --> 28:32.720
and bring home your diploma.

28:32.750 --> 28:34.920
After that, you can do whatever you want.

28:35.000 --> 28:36.320
I won't interfere anymore.

30:01.640 --> 30:02.510
What are you doing?

30:03.590 --> 30:04.400
Just staying here for a bit.

30:04.640 --> 30:06.000
What's there to stay for in the middle of the night?

30:06.000 --> 30:06.750
You have school tomorrow.

30:06.790 --> 30:07.790
Come on, go to bed.

30:08.200 --> 30:08.680
Dad,

30:09.950 --> 30:10.550
don't go yet.

30:11.110 --> 30:11.790
Let's talk for a bit.

30:12.640 --> 30:13.440
Talk about what?

30:14.790 --> 30:15.960
How did you earn

30:16.400 --> 30:17.640
your first pot of gold?

30:26.590 --> 30:27.350
Well, back then,

30:27.350 --> 30:28.960
when I was about your age,

30:29.440 --> 30:30.750
I went to Guangdong

30:31.200 --> 30:33.000
with your Uncle Maotian

30:33.550 --> 30:33.990
to buy goods.

30:33.990 --> 30:34.830
Do you know what we bought?

30:34.880 --> 30:35.400
What?

30:36.110 --> 30:39.000
Gauze and silk scarves for women.

30:40.880 --> 30:42.000
We bought them there

30:42.240 --> 30:43.160
and sold them here.

30:43.200 --> 30:46.200
Do you know how big the price difference was?

30:46.790 --> 30:48.200
Do you remember

30:48.200 --> 30:49.680
our family's first small boat?

30:50.640 --> 30:51.920
It was bought

30:52.590 --> 30:53.440
with that money.

30:53.590 --> 30:54.960
That was our first pot of gold.

30:55.960 --> 30:57.110
Not bad, Dad.

30:58.110 --> 31:00.590
Has mom been captivated by these silk scarves?

31:01.400 --> 31:02.640
She wasn't captivated,

31:03.110 --> 31:04.160
she was trapped.

31:07.160 --> 31:07.790
Dad,

31:08.790 --> 31:09.590
I need to tell you something.

31:09.590 --> 31:10.400
Don't get angry.

31:10.640 --> 31:11.200
Go ahead.

31:12.350 --> 31:13.400
I want to take a leave of absence from school.

31:13.640 --> 31:14.240
Just for a year.

31:15.790 --> 31:17.000
I told you not to get angry.

31:18.590 --> 31:19.590
Take a leave of absence?

31:20.350 --> 31:21.000
Why?

31:23.640 --> 31:24.440
Siyi.

31:25.440 --> 31:27.030
I've warmed up some milk for you.

31:30.110 --> 31:31.440
You haven't finished your homework yet?

31:31.440 --> 31:32.070
Almost done.

31:32.880 --> 31:34.350
Grandma, you should go to bed first.

31:35.400 --> 31:36.070
It's alright.

31:36.440 --> 31:37.070
I'll

31:37.110 --> 31:38.640
knit a sweater to keep you company.

31:56.790 --> 31:57.920
Siyi,

31:59.110 --> 31:59.880
actually,

32:00.400 --> 32:02.680
I'm not against you getting a part-time job.

32:07.110 --> 32:07.920
Grandma.

32:09.400 --> 32:13.200
We didn't have enough food at home when your father was young,

32:13.960 --> 32:15.590
so he went out to earn money.

32:16.440 --> 32:18.710
I won't scold you.

32:19.440 --> 32:22.310
After all, you're both doing it for the family's sake.

32:24.310 --> 32:25.440
Don't worry, Grandma.

32:25.790 --> 32:27.480
I won't let it affect my studies.

32:28.960 --> 32:30.110
Are you sure it won't affect your studies?

32:33.440 --> 32:35.960
I've been watching you from the doorway for a while.

32:36.590 --> 32:37.680
Usually when you're doing homework,

32:37.880 --> 32:39.480
you're very focused.

32:39.480 --> 32:40.880
You can write for an entire evening.

32:41.310 --> 32:43.630
How many times have you yawned just now?

32:47.830 --> 32:48.750
A person's

32:48.750 --> 32:50.480
energy is finite.

32:51.590 --> 32:53.680
I know you're thoughtful,

32:53.680 --> 32:56.400
and that you're trying to ease my burden.

32:59.590 --> 33:00.640
But child,

33:01.350 --> 33:04.160
everything has its priorities.

33:04.830 --> 33:06.070
If your grades are poor

33:06.070 --> 33:06.920
and you can't get into college,

33:06.920 --> 33:08.350
then I would accept it.

33:09.110 --> 33:10.960
But your grades are so good.

33:11.440 --> 33:13.920
Wouldn't you be missing out on such an opportunity?

33:14.830 --> 33:16.160
If you go to work part-time

33:16.440 --> 33:18.160
and ruin your future,

33:18.320 --> 33:20.200
I would feel like I've let your father down.

33:20.590 --> 33:22.720
Your father would blame me too.

33:23.920 --> 33:24.680
Alright,

33:24.680 --> 33:25.960
get back to your homework now.

33:55.790 --> 33:56.550
How much?

33:57.160 --> 33:58.510
The medicine from before 1993

33:58.880 --> 33:59.920
cost more than 8,000 yuan per pill.

34:00.160 --> 34:01.480
It might not even be enough for a pill.

34:02.200 --> 34:03.480
If someone really gets sick,

34:03.960 --> 34:04.680
it can be a big expense

34:05.310 --> 34:06.200
for hospitalization,

34:06.310 --> 34:07.160
nursing staff

34:07.160 --> 34:08.480
and so on.

34:09.110 --> 34:10.590
Given Granny's family situation,

34:11.670 --> 34:13.750
even if Siyi gets into college,

34:14.190 --> 34:15.320
they can't afford it.

34:15.800 --> 34:17.400
So I have to plan ahead.

34:22.630 --> 34:24.070
These...these troublesome matters,

34:24.110 --> 34:26.670
l-let us adults handle them.

34:27.360 --> 34:27.710
Dad,

34:28.590 --> 34:30.360
you used to make money seafaring,

34:31.150 --> 34:32.190
but now?

34:32.190 --> 34:32.960
The highway is open,

34:33.510 --> 34:34.880
and our family business isn't very good.

34:35.159 --> 34:36.550
What are you planning to do about it?

34:39.150 --> 34:41.110
Well, any industry

34:41.110 --> 34:43.360
has its ups and downs.

34:44.800 --> 34:47.440
I believe the canal will improve.

34:47.440 --> 34:48.800
It might get better in the future,

34:48.880 --> 34:49.880
but I can't wait.

34:51.440 --> 34:52.190
You...

34:52.440 --> 34:54.150
Making money isn't that easy.

34:54.360 --> 34:55.150
It's not something that just comes to you

34:55.150 --> 34:56.590
whenever you want it.

34:57.400 --> 34:58.550
Well, I have to try.

34:58.880 --> 34:59.480
I have confidence.

34:59.480 --> 35:00.480
I believe in myself.

35:01.920 --> 35:03.320
It's not about confidence.

35:03.360 --> 35:05.440
You... you need a plan.

35:06.190 --> 35:07.030
I have.

35:07.070 --> 35:07.960
I have several, actually.

35:07.960 --> 35:09.920
I just don't know which one to use right now.

35:10.190 --> 35:11.070
Look at you.

35:11.110 --> 35:11.840
Several plans, huh?

35:11.840 --> 35:13.110
Tell me one of them.

35:13.110 --> 35:14.150
Let's see if it's feasible.

35:14.440 --> 35:16.070
I'll tell you one that doesn't require seed money.

35:16.920 --> 35:17.670
Creating a website.

35:17.960 --> 35:18.760
What kind of website?

35:19.440 --> 35:20.670
Online smart question bank.

35:20.920 --> 35:22.550
It's something that can help students

35:22.590 --> 35:23.880
quickly improve their grades.

35:24.480 --> 35:25.760
If such a thing exists,

35:25.840 --> 35:27.960
can it improve your grades first?

35:27.960 --> 35:28.670
Of course.

35:29.360 --> 35:30.400
I can not only help myself,

35:30.400 --> 35:31.630
but I can help a lot of people.

35:31.630 --> 35:32.710
I can also make big money.

35:34.630 --> 35:35.880
How much can you earn?

35:35.880 --> 35:37.550
At least I'll be the richest person in Honghuai.

35:40.840 --> 35:41.550
Son,

35:42.440 --> 35:43.440
you should

35:43.960 --> 35:45.840
focus on getting into college.

35:45.880 --> 35:47.280
Don't worry about our family matters.

35:49.440 --> 35:50.790
You really don't need me to?

35:52.070 --> 35:53.400
No matter how useless your father is,

35:54.360 --> 35:56.360
he can still provide for the family.

35:59.440 --> 36:01.030
Is that all the ambition you have?

36:02.710 --> 36:03.920
Are you

36:05.030 --> 36:07.040
really disappointed in your father now?

36:07.040 --> 36:07.590
Yes.

36:13.070 --> 36:13.840
Dad,

36:15.230 --> 36:16.920
making no money isn't a big deal,

36:18.230 --> 36:19.960
but you can't lose your aspiration.

36:21.400 --> 36:22.880
As long as you have the spirit,

36:23.360 --> 36:25.550
starting a new business won't be a problem.

36:28.070 --> 36:28.760
Also,

36:29.360 --> 36:29.710
I...

36:30.880 --> 36:31.320
Oh no.

36:35.960 --> 36:36.710
What's wrong?

36:38.430 --> 36:39.280
Your mom must be awake.

36:39.320 --> 36:40.230
she's probably looking for me now.

36:42.840 --> 36:43.920
Where is she?

36:45.760 --> 36:47.230
You two even have telepathy?

36:47.230 --> 36:48.070
Look at you.

36:48.070 --> 36:50.550
I'm telling you, I know what your mom's going to do.

36:50.550 --> 36:52.000
even if she just turns over in bed.

36:56.030 --> 36:57.280
Seems like everything's fine now.

36:57.710 --> 36:58.480
Nope.

36:59.480 --> 37:01.150
Maybe there's too much going on now.

37:01.710 --> 37:02.840
It's not working this time.

37:04.360 --> 37:06.230
Put it on. Don't catch a cold.

37:15.400 --> 37:16.190
Son,

37:17.880 --> 37:18.960
I'll be honest with you.

37:20.400 --> 37:22.480
I'm unable to do anything but seafaring.

37:25.440 --> 37:26.550
If you don't know, then learn.

37:27.360 --> 37:29.320
My dad is so smart and capable.

37:30.440 --> 37:31.760
Once you set your mind to something,

37:31.760 --> 37:33.000
just keep pushing forward,

37:33.710 --> 37:34.550
you'll definitely succeed.

37:37.070 --> 37:37.840
Really?

37:38.880 --> 37:39.590
Really.

38:43.760 --> 38:45.360
Fenghua, wake up.

38:45.360 --> 38:47.110
It's so late. Why aren't you up yet?

38:47.670 --> 38:49.190
What's the matter?

38:49.190 --> 38:50.000
Look at you, dawdling around.

38:50.000 --> 38:50.480
You're so slow.

38:50.480 --> 38:51.110
I'm resting.

38:51.110 --> 38:52.190
Hurry up!

38:52.280 --> 38:53.590
There are so few people on Flower Street.

38:53.590 --> 38:55.190
Business is getting worse.

38:55.480 --> 38:57.320
Let's not set up the stall on weekends anymore.

38:57.400 --> 38:59.400
If you don't set up the stall, what are you going to live on?

38:59.760 --> 39:01.480
You're always saying useless things.

39:06.590 --> 39:07.590
I'm so tired.

39:12.000 --> 39:13.110
Morning, little white girl.

39:15.670 --> 39:18.040
That photographer you mentioned the other day,

39:18.280 --> 39:18.920
is he reliable?

39:19.920 --> 39:20.880
Of course he is.

39:23.920 --> 39:26.000
Why don't we give him a call and ask?

39:27.280 --> 39:27.920
Okay.

39:28.280 --> 39:29.030
Just a moment.

39:36.030 --> 39:36.590
Yes.

39:37.480 --> 39:38.070
Yes, yes.

39:39.070 --> 39:39.630
Alright.

39:39.920 --> 39:40.710
Great, great, great.

39:41.360 --> 39:42.360
Okay, goodbye.

39:43.320 --> 39:44.000
How did it go?

39:44.480 --> 39:45.590
He said we should go over there.

39:45.840 --> 39:46.400
He wants to talk face to face.

39:47.480 --> 39:48.590
To the city?

39:49.760 --> 39:51.000
Well, you're asking to be a model.

39:51.000 --> 39:52.280
If they don't see you in person,

39:52.360 --> 39:53.670
how will they know if you're suitable?

39:55.760 --> 39:56.480
That's true.

39:58.920 --> 40:00.000
If you're scared,

40:00.000 --> 40:01.670
we can ask Shao Xiaopang to come with us.

40:01.760 --> 40:02.760
That guy can keep a secret.

40:03.590 --> 40:04.190
No way.

40:05.070 --> 40:06.710
We can't let too many people know about this.

40:06.840 --> 40:08.000
It wouldn't be good if word goes out.

40:08.800 --> 40:10.000
What's the big deal?

40:10.880 --> 40:12.880
Being a model isn't illegal.

40:13.470 --> 40:14.350
Besides,

40:14.400 --> 40:15.400
once you've taken the photos,

40:15.400 --> 40:16.480
they can be seen online anyway.

40:16.880 --> 40:18.320
Even if you don't say anything now,

40:18.360 --> 40:19.400
everyone will find out sooner or later.

40:23.760 --> 40:26.230
If you want to make money, don't be afraid of losing face.

40:28.590 --> 40:31.110
If the teacher asks later, just say

40:31.110 --> 40:32.030
your relatives opened a shop

40:32.070 --> 40:32.960
and you're helping out.

40:33.480 --> 40:34.800
What era are we living in?

40:34.880 --> 40:36.110
As long as we're not breaking the law,

40:36.110 --> 40:37.590
the more money we make, the more glorious it is.

40:41.840 --> 40:43.320
Let's go.

40:43.320 --> 40:44.960
Time to make some money.

40:55.400 --> 40:56.000
Put them on.

40:57.360 --> 40:57.920
Here.

40:58.880 --> 40:59.760
Take a good look.

41:01.190 --> 41:02.190
What?

41:02.190 --> 41:04.070
The business plan I wrote last night.

41:06.920 --> 41:07.670
Take a look now.

41:08.190 --> 41:09.400
If there are any issues, just say it.

41:09.400 --> 41:10.360
Don't hold back.

41:11.840 --> 41:13.110
Wake up.

41:13.110 --> 41:14.150
Come on, come on.

41:14.190 --> 41:15.190
Hurry up, take a look.

41:22.030 --> 41:23.230
Online question bank.

41:23.670 --> 41:25.320
What do you think? Is it feasible?

41:26.880 --> 41:28.070
There are two key points.

41:29.400 --> 41:31.840
The quality of the questions and intelligent data processing.

41:33.670 --> 41:36.230
We can get questions from major key high schools.

41:36.440 --> 41:38.550
As for the program automation, we can only rely on you.

41:39.310 --> 41:40.880
You think he's Bill Gates?

41:40.880 --> 41:42.110
Studying and working at the same time.

41:42.110 --> 41:42.590
Even if you work him to death

41:42.590 --> 41:43.480
he can't finish it all.

41:44.400 --> 41:45.550
We'll start small.

41:45.590 --> 41:48.030
We can use existing programming templates.

41:48.670 --> 41:49.480
Once we have money,

41:49.480 --> 41:50.630
then we can spend it

41:50.670 --> 41:52.000
to hire programmers from outside.

41:52.600 --> 41:54.590
There are virtual servers online,

41:54.710 --> 41:57.960
but if you want to guarantee storage and internet speed,

41:57.960 --> 41:59.710
you must rent a dedicated server.

42:00.480 --> 42:01.480
Then let's go to Beijing.

42:02.110 --> 42:03.350
I've already talked to my dad.

42:04.880 --> 42:05.710
He didn't agree.

42:06.480 --> 42:07.960
But he didn't object either.

42:10.230 --> 42:11.400
What's the use of your dad agreeing?

42:11.670 --> 42:13.360
You won't get your mom's approval.

42:13.710 --> 42:14.990
We have to try, right?

42:15.670 --> 42:16.590
I don't believe

42:16.590 --> 42:18.280
When Bill Gates dropped out from Harvard,

42:18.320 --> 42:19.360
his mom could agree.

42:19.480 --> 42:20.480
To do great things,

42:20.480 --> 42:21.800
we must all forge ahead through difficulties.

42:22.320 --> 42:23.360
Anyway, I must do this.

42:33.870 --> 42:35.030
If we really can make money,

42:35.230 --> 42:35.920
how do you want to spend it?

42:37.070 --> 42:37.920
First, pay off debts.

42:38.280 --> 42:39.710
I haven't finished paying off

42:39.710 --> 42:40.880
my mom's debts yet.

42:43.440 --> 42:44.710
I plan to buy a phone,

42:44.880 --> 42:45.920
the latest model.

42:46.190 --> 42:46.800
Then,

42:46.920 --> 42:49.070
I'll make calls in front of Xie Wanghe every day.

42:50.230 --> 42:51.430
Hello, darling,

42:51.710 --> 42:53.280
have you been missing me these days?

42:53.400 --> 42:54.480
Which darling?

42:55.440 --> 42:55.920
It doesn't matter.

42:56.030 --> 42:58.190
The point is to make him see my new phone.

42:58.550 --> 42:59.760
I'll make him so jealous.
